{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Imagine, how could spirits and mythical creatures feel these days? What if they were closer, than it could seem? Perhaps, your classmate nearby or a guy selling you street food may appear as one of them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a story about Kot - a house spirit in the shape of a cat. It\u2019s lost its owner and his powers leave him insensibly. It has to find a new owner to survive before they disappear. But what if he meets a lost kitten? Or a restless soul? Or a thirsting demon hunting the weakend hero\u2019s energy remains?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Here you can control the character\u2019s fate and the events of the story. Make your choice, fights with demons, save kittens and punish villains  All in your paws.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250230/extras/\u0418\u043d\u0442\u0435\u0440\u0430\u043a\u0442\u0438\u0432.gif?t=1746175825\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple endings, non linear playthrough</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visual novel with interactive elements. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original soundtracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fairy tale characters in the modern world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cats!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250230/extras/\u041c\u0438\u043d\u0438-\u0438\u0433\u0440\u0430_.gif?t=1746175825\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2250230?t=1746175825","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250230/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746175825","capsule_image"